			"date": "2025-07-01T21:02:28.941Z",
			"content": "<p>I'm currently using 11ty to build a 400+ page site, then adding a couple of 1-2K web components here and there to enhance the functionality. The actual 400+ page build takes, like, less than a second. Would probably take longer to build *one* page clientside, in a SPA.</p>",
