			"date": "2025-07-01T23:29:36.605Z",
			"content": "<p>I was mildly curious if there was anything called Yoink...</p>\n<p>10years old...</p>\n<p>&gt; HTML is for web documents. <br>\n&gt; JavaScript is for web applications. <br>\n&gt; The Yoink framework lets us code exclusively in JavaScript</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/garious/yoink\">github.com/garious/yoink</a></p>",
